# STGR repo attributes.
#
# The STGR patch series is authored and validated with LF line endings.
# The Firefox upstream tree is always LF (its .gitattributes forces `* -text`),
# and git apply only matches CRLF patches against CRLF trees. Forcing `eol=lf`
# here keeps the patches LF on every checkout (Windows core.autocrlf=true
# would otherwise check them out CRLF and the series would fail to apply).
*.patch text eol=lf
patches/series text eol=lf
